THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

Jetpack Compose, AndroidX
  Google -- Apache-2.0.

The FLAC decoder, the tag readers, the spectrum and DR analysis and the
fingerprint are written for this app. The fingerprint follows the method in
Haitsma and Kalker, "A Highly Robust Audio Fingerprinting System", ISMIR 2002;
the dynamic range follows the TT DR Offline Meter's published method.
